# The Vercel project uses `landing` as its monorepo Root Directory. Upload only
# that project; never send desktop build outputs, local models, or repo tooling.
/*
!landing
!landing/**

# The Vercel deployment is zero-config, so every file under the Root Directory
# is served. Without this the suite below would be fetchable at
# https://mityu.bluedev.dev/tests/whats-new.test.mjs — internal process notes on
# the marketing domain. CI runs it from the repository, not from the upload.
landing/tests
landing/README.md
